'''Tails Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained as a stamp reward during the [[Sonic the Hedgehog Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 14.4 Update|Version 14.4]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BJCP]] and [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 808
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Tails Cat
|name2 = Tails Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Tails Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Tails Cat isn't exactly the best at slowing [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angels]] due to his first form having a 50% chance to slow them for 2 seconds. His second form is better because of its guaranteed chance to slow for 2.4 seconds post-Treasures, but that is still a 48% uptime, which makes him unviable once [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo's]] Target Angel [[Talents|Talent]] is unlocked. The closest niche for this unit is a no-gacha counter to [[Angelic Sleipnir]] and [[St. Dober]], but that's about it.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & User Rank Dump}}

